[I] Tux status screen for the VMU LCD

[T] Shows Tux on the Dreamcast VMU LCD: the IP address after DHCP in a
[T] speech bubble, then RAM and swap use (Tux's belly fills with used RAM,
[T] he sweats while swapping and gets dizzy when nearly out of memory).

[A] foxdrodd
[M] foxdrodd

[C] extra/graphic
[F] CROSS

[L] GPL
[V] 1.0
[D] 0 vmu_lcd_status.c https://raw.githubusercontent.com/foxdrodd/dreamcast-linux/refs/heads/master/drivers/vmu-lcd/

runmake=0 runconf=0 autoextract=0
hook_add inmake 5 "cd $archdir;$CC -Os -o vmu_lcd_status vmu_lcd_status.c"
hook_add postmake 5 "cd $archdir;cp -vf vmu_lcd_status $root$bindir/"
